{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act28side_level_act28side_01_beg",
  "groupId": "act28side",
  "stageId": "act28side_01",
  "title": "孤獨之地",
  "storyCode": "CV-1",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act28side/level_act28side_01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "27f2a4a4743b3a7251829bb30543259b1e5fa8ce6f05159b4a11e7dfeb1ebf5c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "慌亂間，潔西卡摸向腰間的手銃，可恐懼讓她的手指搭在銃套上，遲遲無法彎曲。\n她隱約從寒風中嗅到了一絲腥氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別亂動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一位獵人從林中走進潔西卡的視線，他手裡的銃還在冒煙，寬大的帽檐遮住了眼睛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她轉身再看向身後，一具野獸的屍體橫躺在雪地上，頭上的傷口還在汩汩地流著鮮血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的獵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在這裡你該多留點神。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……謝謝您……救了我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的獵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "順手罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老人一邊收起銃，一邊徑直走向野獸的屍體。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他抽出小刀，破開野獸的腹部，角度精準，沒有多少血液流出。\n隨後，他將雙手塞入屍體腹內，發出一聲長長的嘆息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的獵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這鬼天氣真是他媽冷得要死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……老先生，您是附近的獵人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的獵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算是吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您知道達維鎮該怎麼走嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的獵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……你去那裡做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我打算在那裡和隊友會合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的獵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不是一個人來的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，我和隊友分頭行動，從一夥流寇手中營救了一名人質，但任務結束後我的通訊器意外損壞，在林子裡迷了路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的獵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "人質？長什麼樣子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是位年老的豐蹄男性……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的獵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……居然是你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的獵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那好，跟我走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "去、去哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的獵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不是要去達維鎮嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的獵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "來不來隨你便。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老人沒再看潔西卡，起身將野獸屍體扛在肩上，快步向林子深處走去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等，等等！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎，潔西卡一個人在外面，你真的放心嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道你擔心潔西卡，我也一樣。但是一起戰鬥這麼多年，我相信她有能力獨自處理好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只是不確定還會不會有殘餘的匪徒。兩三個倒沒問題，可萬一他們還有殘部呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "潔西卡曾經歷過的戰鬥可比那些烏合之眾危險得多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要嘛是箭簇貼著頭皮飛過，要嘛是利刃擦著喉嚨劃過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "再要不，四周全是高濃度的活性源石粉塵，防護服稍微裂開一個小小的口子，立刻就能在那裡升天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但每一次她的任務都順利完成了，沒有我們的陪同，也不在我們的視線裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她只有一個人，但什麼都做得非常好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……我不否認。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可你也知道，每次任務完成，她都眼眶通紅地回來。在她回來見我們之前，哭得眼淚汪汪的時候，總得有個人在身邊吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "通紅的眼眶代表什麼？代表她每次都是擦乾眼淚才來見我們，她不樂意別人見到她哭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可她才二十三歲——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊，二十三歲，而且過去三年裡有兩年半都花在戰場上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老先生，請問附近有什麼東西爆炸了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的獵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好像又聽到了，就在附近……難道是我幻聽了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的獵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不是爆炸，是樹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "樹？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的獵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "林子裡太冷，樹液凍結之後會膨脹，把樹幹裡的組織撐裂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "聽起來……就像從遠處傳來的交火聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的獵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你到底是什麼人？軍隊，僱傭兵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "僱傭兵，差不多當了五年了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的獵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你家裡欠債了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不……只是我……不想受家裡人的庇護，走家裡人為我安排好的道路……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的獵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以你就去當傭兵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是、是啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的獵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哼，那你在戰場上尋找什麼？財富、名聲，還是榮譽？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，我要做的是排除危機，解決衝突，在險境中保護別人……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的獵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦……原來傭兵是幹這個的，我還是頭一回知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老先生……我們不是普通的傭兵公司，我們……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“橋夾”克里夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "提醒你一句，潔西卡，你是傭兵，你的任務只是生意，不是義務。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的獵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好了，打住吧，我不關心那個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "打擾了二位，你們剛剛聊的人是位有五年實戰經歷的“資深”傭兵嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，你有什麼見解要發表，小羅拉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們和潔西卡共事的時間比我長，她的能力跟極限，你們應該比我更清楚，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以你覺得潔西卡自己能搞定？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當然。雷蛇隊長說得沒錯，過去三年裡，她去過的地方比這裡危險得多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然一想到潔西卡淚汪汪的樣子，我也會不由自主地擔心，但其實我們誰都知道，她沒問題的，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "除了她自己不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊，只有她自己不知道……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但她可能就差那麼一個機會了，一個讓她看清自己的機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "難道你想說現在就是那個機會？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃……倒也不是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老、老先生……老先生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的獵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小姐，你有點吵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，我不是故意想吵您……但您能不能看看那裡……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "潔西卡指向遠處樹旁的一處獸夾。\n在那裡，一隻幼獸的前腿被鋼夾緊緊咬住。幼獸不停地哀鳴，血從咬合處緩緩滲出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老獵人看到後，放下野獸屍體，走到樹下解開捕獸夾，將幼獸從夾子裡取出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還是幼崽……或許我們可以把它放了。要是母獸在附近，應該很快就能找來……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "再說，我聽說獵人冬天會放過母獸和幼崽，讓獸群得以繁衍……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的獵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它母親已經在這裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您剛剛打死的那隻野獸是它的母親？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的獵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我見過這隻帶崽的母獸好幾次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的獵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在，大的被打死了，小的不知踩在哪個冒失鬼放的夾子上，獸皮都壞了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那……我們現在該拿這隻幼獸怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的獵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "擰斷它的脖子，給它一個痛快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼會？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的獵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不然呢？沒了母親又斷了腿，它馬上就死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的獵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "或者你也可以把它留在這裡慢慢咽氣，我也沒意見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……它沒法活下去，是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的獵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "請您把它給我吧……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的獵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你要自己動手？請便。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "噓……沒事了，小傢伙……沒事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "將幼獸抱在臂彎裡，潔西卡順著它的皮毛輕輕撫摸。\n她沒做任何事，只是慢慢等待著幼獸的哀鳴漸漸微弱，直至徹底消失。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我救不了它，但我至少……能讓它在一個溫暖的懷抱裡離開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的獵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "傭兵做臨終關懷？我還是第一次見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……我能把它放在這裡嗎，老先生？我想……那頭母獸作為獵物來講已經夠大了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的獵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼？還要我再幫你把它埋了，然後舉行葬禮嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，冬天林子裡的動物都飢腸轆轆的，留在這裡……說不定也能讓它們飽餐一頓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的獵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我是心腸軟不錯……但也不會因此什麼事都搞不清。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年老的獵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然你搞得清楚，那就跟緊吧，傭兵小姐，你應該也不想在林子裡再迷一次路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "風把霧氣吹散了……邁爾斯先生，您讓我們停下就是為了在這裡看一眼達維鎮嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……年輕時，我就喜歡跑到地塊附近的高地上，看看自己生活的鎮子到底是個什麼模樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那時它是什麼樣的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "熱鬧些、光鮮些……更有生命力些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現如今……唉，回不到從前了……回不到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘶……真的好冷啊。原來……我們的目標地點是這個樣子啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "芙蘭卡……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "想什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只是……突然又想到潔西卡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "想什麼？你又不擔心她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……我在想我們剛剛說的“機會”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，你說那個“讓她看清自己的機會”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "或許，終有一天……那個機會也會像陣風一樣吹過，或許會很冷，會讓潔西卡在風中狠狠打哆嗦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是那些在她眼前的迷霧也會被風捲走，在她前方的一切都會變得很清晰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但願她看到的……不會是我們眼前的景象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "散開的霧氣中，由斷木殘枝組成的巨大轍痕順著山坡蜿蜒向下，一直延伸到谷地中央。\n盡頭處是一片擱淺的地塊。\n雖然相隔甚遠，但所有人都能看見，在地塊中心，一座高聳入雲的能源塔正有氣無力地噴吐著白息。\n如垂危的病人那般，艱難喘息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
